    {
      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 0)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\"><strong>Mermaid Tail</strong>: I don't know if mermaids are real but if they are, I'd like to think they have iridescent scales with a personality that matches. The shimmer from their scales and the glistening aura of their nature has captivated story-tellers since the beginning of storytelling. This work is dedicated to all the beautiful mermaids hidden in life.</span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">24” X 36” Mixed media acrylic painting with organic plaster base layer on gallery wrapped canvas. Ready to hand.</span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">For serious inquiries please email vudiphothisukart@gmail.com</span></p></div>",
      "text": "Mermaid Tail: I don't know if mermaids are real but if they are, I'd like to think they have iridescent scales with a personality that matches. The shimmer from their scales and the glistening aura of their nature has captivated story-tellers since the beginning of storytelling. This work is dedicated to all the beautiful mermaids hidden in life.24” X 36” Mixed media acrylic painting with organic plaster base layer on gallery wrapped canvas. Ready to hand.For serious inquiries please email vudiphothisukart@gmail.com"
